{"id":"en_the-sun-god-s-beloved","title":"The Sun God’s Beloved","titleEn":"The Sun God’s Beloved","description":"Kallydia serves as head priestess at the Temple of Philotia, but her mother pressures her into using her position to lure the Sun God Helios for financial gain. After enchanted incense brings them together for a night, Kallydia slips away before sunrise, leaving behind a silver armband inscribed with her name.\n\nHelios develops feelings for her, yet a misunderstanding convinces him she is merely an opportunist who manipulates men. His fury leads him to sever all ties with her.\n\nKallydia then learns she is carrying his child. Isolated, she endures public shame and cruelty from her family while protecting the fragile golden spark of life within her. When the God of War and the Goddess of Wisdom appear, they expose the truth—the gentle servant they recall is the very woman Helios denounced.\n\nH","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-sun-gods-beloved/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-sun-gods-beloved/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Mythology","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djmfs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-sun-god-s-beloved_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djmfs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-sun-god-s-beloved_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djmfs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-sun-god-s-beloved_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djmf